                "text": "Grant news for #NC11: Two Appalachian Regional Commission grants are coming to Western North Carolina to increase workforce participation.\n\nJackson County's HIGHTS will receive $18,000 to expand the behavioral health workforce in WNC, and @LandofSkyRC will receive nearly $500,000 for their partnership with substance use treatment courts to provide workforce training to recovering addicts.\n\nIt\u2019s encouraging to see these resources coming to our district to better our community.",
