                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Did you know that before Dr. Ben Carson received national attention for his political career, he was the first to successfully perform a groundbreaking surgery separating conjoined twins at the head?\n\nDr. Carson not only made medical history by pushing the boundaries of what\u2019s possible, he created a framework for doctors to follow in the future and went on to perform hundreds of other complex and impressive surgeries. #BlackHistoryMonth",
                "text_lang": "en",
