                "reply_count": 12,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In honor of every fallen soldier, including those lost to their silent struggle with mental health, I've introduced the Justice for America\u2019s Veterans and Survivors Act to improve data accuracy and transparency related to veteran suicide and enable better policymaking.\n\nOur veterans make immense sacrifices to defend our great nation and citizens, and we owe it to them to make sure that they have the support and resources they need as they transition back to civilian life.",
