                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Myth: Republicans want to slash health care coverage.\n\nFact: House Republicans are working to lower health care costs\u00a0for families. We just passed the Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act, which reduces premium costs by expanding affordable coverage options for small businesses, increasing competition among insurers, and cutting bureaucratic red tape that drives up costs so families can keep more of their hard-earned money.",
